{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorsVuRZjYunmhjbM5fL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've gone through all ten screens, so here's the answer.\n\n**Bottom line:** The \"מה האתר עוד לא מכסה\" page lists about 35 cards, all tagged \"לא מחושב\". For my setup the relevant gaps are gold (ETC, gold תעודת סל), foreign-currency stuff (dollar-hedged funds, dollar deposits, FX accounts, the exchange-rate fee), REITs, structured products, savings policies, ביטוח מנהלים, corporate bonds, robo-advisors and portfolio management. A second list rules out mortgages and loans, other insurance, picking stocks, trading and derivatives, physical real estate, ranking by past returns, and actually executing anything. Plain index ETFs aren't on either list, so I assume those are covered. I'm fairly sure of this. What decided it is that every card carries the red \"לא מחושב\" tag and a \"חסום: שאלה פתוחה\" box saying what's blocking it.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- The heading \"מוצרים שהאתר מכיר אבל עוד לא יכול להסביר עד הסוף, ולמה\".\n- The red banner \"החוקים והכללים לכל המוצרים כאן עוד בבדיקה\".\n- Card titles and the \"לא מחושב\" tags, all the way down.\n- The open \"מצב הכיסוי\" folds, for the open questions, which are mostly about tax: gold funds, FX deposits, savings policies, structured deposits, ביטוח לאומי on REITs.\n- The final \"לא משווה ולא עושה\" list, and the footer \"אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\". No broker name anywhere, which is good.\n\n**What I skipped or only skimmed:**\n- The \"מה ידוע\" definitions on the cards.\n- The legal citations and dates.\n- The badges \"מקור ראשי\" and \"לפי החברה\".\n- A few titles were cut off where one screenshot ended and the next began. I worked out נאמן and ניהול תיקים from their descriptions, so I could be wrong on those.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- **The heading promises \"מוצרים\", but many items aren't products.** \"LBMA Gold Price\" is a price benchmark. \"עמלת חליפין\" is a fee. \"נאמן\" and \"חברת דירוג\" are roles or companies, \"הסדר חוב\" is something that happens to a bond, \"מענק\" is a feature of a deposit, and \"היוון קצבה מוכרת\", \"תיקון 190\" and \"תשלומים פטורים\" are tax mechanics. When the list can't keep to its own heading, I don't fully trust what else it says.\n- **The two lists overlap.** Savings policies and ביטוח מנהלים are under \"not yet\", while the permanent list says \"ביטוח, חוץ מפוליסות חיסכון\". Similarly REIT funds are \"not yet\" but physical real estate is \"never\". It works if you read it carefully, but it's fiddly.\n- **The FX rate isn't calculated.** \"עמלת חליפין\" being \"לא מחושב\" means the shekel-to-dollar cost on my US ETFs is exactly what it can't show me. I was really after one cost figure to compare with what I pay, and there isn't one here.\n- **It's very long.** It's a two-column wall of cards with no filter and no summary table. I'd have closed it around screen 4 if I didn't need the full list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3682,"cache_read_input_tokens":19203,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3682},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"329f544a-c5b4-4667-b20a-a1fa9b81faf2","uuid":"61d426ff-abe0-4864-b989-78240b5f35c9","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:11:28.230Z","request_id":"req_011CgorsVhGqmFwWwCtLk7Rp"}
